  "prefLabel": "Puc 1105.02 System Maps",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1105.02 System Maps. Each utility shall have on file at its principal office located within the state a map, maps or drawings showing the following:\n\n(a) Size, character and location of mains, including valves;\n\n(b) Size and location of each service line, where practicable, provided that in lieu of showing service locations on maps, a card record or other suitable means may be used.\n\n(c) Layout of all principal production plants and other facilities to show size, location and character of all major equipment, pipe lines, connections, valves and other equipment used.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter heading Puc 1100) #6445, eff 1-28-97; ss by #8244, eff 12-31-04; ss by #10307, eff 4-9-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc1100.html"
